WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:01.147 --> 00:00:04.000
(upbeat music)

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.810
(crowd shouting)

3
00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:09.693
You see this sad mediocre state of affairs here?

4
00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.730
It's always gonna be the same with those three.

5
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:15.960
Yeah, I guess Kevin's not the only

6
00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.370
one looking for a title shot.

7
00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:19.623
I haven't even been given my rematch yet.

8
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.560
Wouldn't be the craziest thing.

9
00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.120
The two best guys on SmackDown,

10
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.833
fighting for the WWE Championship?

11
00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:28.263
That would be wild.

12
00:00:30.455 --> 00:00:31.590
Hey.
Senores.

13
00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:33.900
Hey, am I interrupting a moment here?

14
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:35.670
A little bit.
Okay.

15
00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:37.920
Well, since I have both of you here,

16
00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.260
I wanted to officially introduce

17
00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.990
the newest member of Team Mexico,

18
00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:46.140
the AAA Cruiserweight Champion,

19
00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.200
and the soon to be intercontinental champion.

20
00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:50.043
Rey Fenix.

21
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.703
Hola.
Amigos.

22
00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:57.120
It's a big honor to step in the ring

23
00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:59.400
with all of you legends.

24
00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.500
But believe me when I'm saying,

25
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.870
I'm doing this not just for me.

26
00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:08.070
I'm doing this for my country, for my family,

27
00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:10.083
for the love of Lucha libre.
Yes.

28
00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:12.237
Okay.

29
00:01:13.199 --> 00:01:16.050
So I'll leave you guys to it.

30
00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:18.780
I'm sure you have some recruiting to do.

31
00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.509
How do you say good luck in Spanish?

32
00:01:20.509 --> 00:01:21.572
(Rey speaking in Spanish)

33
00:01:21.572 --> 00:01:25.347
(all speaking in Spanish)

34
00:01:25.347 --> 00:01:26.790
Ah, well, he's not wrong.

35
00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:28.230
We got some recruiting to do.

36
00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:29.493
You got a plan, Captain?

37
00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:31.800
Yeah, I got a plan.

38
00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:33.180
I figured you did.

39
00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:36.603
But just in case, some suggestions?

40
00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:40.353
I love suggestions.

41
00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.333
Keep an open mind.

